VERIFICATION
Verification is intended to assist the Chocolatey moderators and community
in verifying that this package's contents are trustworthy.

The embedded installer is built from the source in @REPO_URL@
and published with the matching GitHub release:

  @RELEASE_URL@

To verify, download the installer from the release and compare checksums:

  Get-FileHash .\@SETUP_NAME@ -Algorithm SHA256

  SHA256: @SETUP_SHA256@

